    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be part of a unique shooter where everyone is invisible by default!</strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ghosts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A ghost spawns at each player's location at set intervals. Use them to get a hint of where other players might be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883690/extras/dd39537958b8941a7a7a3337403a1876.poster.avif?t=1755083392\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883690/extras/dd39537958b8941a7a7a3337403a1876.webm?t=1755083392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883690/extras/dd39537958b8941a7a7a3337403a1876.mp4?t=1755083392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Revealing players</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many different pieces of equipment to reveal other players, each working differently. Choose the right one for the right situation! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883690/extras/75067747cf7476cd242b06dc177da11c.poster.avif?t=1755083392\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883690/extras/75067747cf7476cd242b06dc177da11c.webm?t=1755083392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883690/extras/75067747cf7476cd242b06dc177da11c.mp4?t=1755083392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game currently features 4 different game modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capture</strong>: Collect, protect and steal gems to earn points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deathmatch</strong>: Be the first to reach the target kill count.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bomb Defusal</strong>:\u00a0Attackers plant, defenders defuse.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elimination</strong>: Play as a team to eliminate the opposing team.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883690/extras/76e8906ce13e3d7e984b58e56ecbebf7.poster.avif?t=1755083392\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883690/extras/76e8906ce13e3d7e984b58e56ecbebf7.webm?t=1755083392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883690/extras/76e8906ce13e3d7e984b58e56ecbebf7.mp4?t=1755083392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game configs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each game mode can be configured individually to make every match feel unique. Combine different settings to make the game your own!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883690/extras/0fa0bf8cfc6d47e6f57f6ab8c7407454.poster.avif?t=1755083392\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883690/extras/0fa0bf8cfc6d47e6f57f6ab8c7407454.webm?t=1755083392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883690/extras/0fa0bf8cfc6d47e6f57f6ab8c7407454.mp4?t=1755083392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be part of a unique shooter where everyone is invisible by default!</strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ghosts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A ghost spawns at each player's location at set intervals. Use them to get a hint of where other players might be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883690/extras/dd39537958b8941a7a7a3337403a1876.poster.avif?t=1755083392\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883690/extras/dd39537958b8941a7a7a3337403a1876.webm?t=1755083392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883690/extras/dd39537958b8941a7a7a3337403a1876.mp4?t=1755083392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Revealing players</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many different pieces of equipment to reveal other players, each working differently. Choose the right one for the right situation! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883690/extras/75067747cf7476cd242b06dc177da11c.poster.avif?t=1755083392\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883690/extras/75067747cf7476cd242b06dc177da11c.webm?t=1755083392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883690/extras/75067747cf7476cd242b06dc177da11c.mp4?t=1755083392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game currently features 4 different game modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capture</strong>: Collect, protect and steal gems to earn points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deathmatch</strong>: Be the first to reach the target kill count.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bomb Defusal</strong>:\u00a0Attackers plant, defenders defuse.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elimination</strong>: Play as a team to eliminate the opposing team.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883690/extras/76e8906ce13e3d7e984b58e56ecbebf7.poster.avif?t=1755083392\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883690/extras/76e8906ce13e3d7e984b58e56ecbebf7.webm?t=1755083392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883690/extras/76e8906ce13e3d7e984b58e56ecbebf7.mp4?t=1755083392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game configs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each game mode can be configured individually to make every match feel unique. Combine different settings to make the game your own!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883690/extras/0fa0bf8cfc6d47e6f57f6ab8c7407454.poster.avif?t=1755083392\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883690/extras/0fa0bf8cfc6d47e6f57f6ab8c7407454.webm?t=1755083392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883690/extras/0fa0bf8cfc6d47e6f57f6ab8c7407454.mp4?t=1755083392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Invite your friends to this first-person shooter for up to 6 players, where everyone is INVISIBLE! Use various mechanics to expose their location while trying to stay hidden yourself. This party game features different game modes with customizable lobbies.",
